"s":25,"a":63,"sd":null},{"k":"25:64","t":"And those who spend [part of] the night to their Lord prostrating and standing [in prayer]","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":64,"sd":null},{"k":"25:65","t":"And those who say, \"Our Lord, avert from us the punishment of Hell. Indeed, its punishment is ever adhering;","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":65,"sd":null},{"k":"25:66","t":"Indeed, it is evil as a settlement and residence.\"","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":66,"sd":null},{"k":"25:67","t":"And [they are] those who, when they spend, do so not excessively or sparingly but are ever, between that, [justly] moderate","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":67,"sd":null}],"juz":19,"hizb":37,"surahs":[25],"sajdah":true}